# text = impossible is such a peculiar word Impossible , Mr . Grey , you must confess , is a very peculiar word I said impossible , my Lord , because I did conceive , that had your Lordship been of a disposition to which such overtures might have been made with any probability of success , the Marquess of Carabas would have been in a situation which would have precluded the possibility of those overtures being made at all Hah Yes , my Lord , I am a young , an inexperienced young man , ignorant of the world's ways ; doubtless I was wrong , but I have much to learn but I did conceive , that having power at his command , the Marquess of Carabas did not exercise it , merely because he despised it : but what should I know of such matters , my Lord Is power a thing so easily to be despised , young man Merchants and Bankers of London to the Right Honourable Sydney Lorraine , President , & amp ; c ., & amp ; c ., & amp ; c Oh , no ! my Lord , you mistake me I am no cold-blooded philosopher that would despise that , for which , in my opinion , men , real men , should alone exist .
