# text = With your Lordship's tried and splendid talents , everything might be done ; but , in my opinion , if , instead of a practised , an experienced , and wary Statesman , I was now addressing an idiot Earl , I should not see that the great end might not equally be consummated Say you so , my merry man , and how Why , my Lord : but , but , I feel that I am trespassing on your Lordship's time , otherwise I think I could show why society is of opinion that your Lordship can do all and everything ; how , indeed , your Lordship might , in a very short time , be Prime Minister No , Mr . Grey ; this conversation must be finished .
