# text = No , I am no shot ; not that I have not hi my time cultivated a Manton ; but the truth is , having , at an early age , mistaken my intimate friend for a cock pheasant , I sent a whole crowd of fours into his face , and thereby spoilt one of the prettiest countenances in Christendom ; so I gave up the field .
