# text = But , sir , perhaps all this time I am in error ; perhaps Mr . Cleveland is , as the world reports him , no longer the ambitious being who once commanded the admiration of a listening Senate ; perhaps , convinced of the vanity of human wishes , Mr . Cleveland would rather devote his attention to the furtherance of the interests of his immediate circle ; and , having schooled his intellect in the Universities of two nations , is probably content to pass the hours of his life in mediating in the quarrels of a country village Come , Mr .
