# text = I hope that he will not be less acceptable to Lady Madeleine Trevor because he is no longer rash , passionate , and unthinking ; because he has learnt to live more for others and less for himself Baron von Konigstein does indeed appear changed , since , by his own account , he has become , in a very few years , a being in whose existence philosophers scarcely believe , a perfect man My self-conceit has been so often reproved by you , that I will not apologise for a quality which I almost flattered myself I no longer possessed ; but you will excuse , I am sure , one who , in zealous haste to prove himself amended , has , I fear , almost shown that he has deceived himself
