# text = The violent death of a woman , young , lovely , and innocent , is assuredly the most terrible of tragedies I have often asked myself which is the most terrible destiny for the young to endure : to meet death after a life of anxiety and suffering , or suddenly to be cut off in the enjoyment of all things that make life delightful For my part in the last instance , I think that death can scarcely be considered an evil .
