# text = By-the-bye , Mr . Grey , I am afraid that you cannot find this evening very amusing , the absence of a favourite pursuit always makes a sensible void , and these walls must remind you of more piquant pleasures than waltzing with fine London ladies , or promenading up a dull terrace with an invalid I assure you that you are quite misinformed as to the mode in which I generally pass my evenings I hope I am I wish I could also he mistaken in my suspicions of the mode in which Albert spends his time .
