# text = After a ten hours' ride , its flavour is as grateful to the palate as its strength is refreshing to the heart ; but though old Hock , in homely phrase , is styled meat and drink , I confess to you that , at this moment , I stand in need of even more solid sustenance than the juice of the sunny hill A traitor a traitor No traitor noble and right thirsty lords , but one of the most hungry mortals that ever yet famished Silence , my Lords Forget we that ignorance is the stranger's portion , and that no treason can exist among those who are not our sworn subjects ?
