# text = Discussions on a free press , on the reformation of the criminal code , on the abolition of commercial duties , and such like interminable topics , are perpetually resounding within the palace of this arbitrary Prince ; and the people , fired by the representations of the literary and political journals with which Reisenburg abounds , and whose bold speculations on all subjects elude the vigilance of the censor , by being skilfully amalgamated with a lavish praise of the royal character , are perpetually flattered with the speedy hope of becoming freemen .
