# text = The Crown Prince of all countries is only a puppet in the hands of the people , to be played against his own father When we have finished our meal , my good friend I very much wish to consult with you on a most important business I am ready at once You will think it strange , Mr . Grey , when you become acquainted with the nature of my communication ; you will justly consider it most strange , most singular , that I should choose for a confidant and a counsellor in an important business a gentleman with whom I have been acquainted so short a time as yourself .
