# text = It was of too interesting a nature easily to escape my memory Before I can consult you on the subject which at present interests me , it is necessary that I should make you a little acquainted with the present state of public affairs here , and the characters of the principal individuals who control them So far as an account of the present state of political parties , the history of the Grand Duke's career , and that of his Minister , Mr . Beckendorff , and their reputed characters , will form part of your Highness's narrative , by so much may its length be curtailed and your trouble lessened ; for I have at different times picked up , in casual conversation , a great deal of information on these topics .
