# text = My good lady , I am hungry , very hungry , indeed ; and if your master , I mean Mr . von , that is Mr . Beckendorff , has such a bad appetite that he can satisfy himself with picking , once a day , the breast of a pheasant ; why , if he expect his friends to be willing or even able to live on such fare , the least that I can say is , that he is much mistaken ; and so , therefore , my good friend Grey , I think we had better order our horses and be off
