# text = His secession and the consequent desertion of his relatives destroy the party for ever ; while , at the same time , that party have not even the consolation of a good conscience to uphold them in their adversity ; but feel that in case of their clamour , or of any attempt to stir up the people by their hollow patriotism , it is in the power of the Minister to expose and crush them for ever All this makes me the more rejoice that our friend has got out of their clutches ; he will make an excellent Grand Marshal ; and you must not forget , my dear sir , that he did not forget you .
