# text = In good truth ,' as Master Rodolph was wont to say But of this packet Fairly and softly ,' good sir ! as Hunsdrich the porter said when I would have drunk the mulled wine , while he was on the cold staircase Essper ! do you mean to enrage me By St . Hubert !' as that worthy gentleman the Grand Marshal was in the habit of swearing , I This is too much ; what are the idle sayings of these people to me Nay , nay , kind sir ! they do but show that each of us has his own way of telling a story , and that he who would hear a tale must let the teller's breath come out of his own nostrils Well , Essper , speak on !
