# text = If your beds were as good as your adages in good truth , as a friend of mine would say , I would sleep here to-night Prithee , friend what accommodation dost thou lack in the way of accommodation , little , for two excellent beds will content us ; but in the way of refreshment , by St . Hubert ! as another friend of mine would swear , he would be a bold man who would engage to be as hungry before his dinner as I shall be after my supper Friend Our Lady forbid that thou shouldst leave our walls to-night : for the accommodation , we have more than sufficient ; and as for the refreshment , by Holy Mass ! we had a priest tarry here last night , and he left his rosary behind .
